---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Flourish from "../components/Flourish.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Us"
  description="Behind the lens at Wedding by Dimple — a team that becomes part of your family before the wedding day arrives."
>
  <section class="relative flex min-h-[60vh] items-end overflow-hidden bg-ink">
    <img
      src="https://picsum.photos/seed/about-hero/1800/1000"
      alt="Wedding by Dimple team at work"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-70 animate-kenburns"
      width="1800"
      height="1000"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink via-ink/20 to-ink/10"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 px-6 pb-16 pt-40 md:px-10">
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-marigold-light reveal-on-scroll">About Us</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl leading-tight text-ivory sm:text-5xl reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-100">
        Preview behind the lens
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-20 md:px-10 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl reveal-on-scroll">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl italic leading-snug text-wine">
        At Wedding by Dimple, we arrive as your photographers, but we leave
        as a part of your family.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
        <p>
          We believe the most beautiful photographs are created when there's
          trust, comfort, and a genuine connection. Before we become your
          photographers, we become people you can laugh with, rely on, and
          feel completely yourself around. We take the time to know you,
          understand your story, and make every moment feel natural.
        </p>
        <p>
          By the time your wedding day arrives, we're not strangers behind
          cameras — we're a familiar presence celebrating alongside you and
          your family. That comfort allows real smiles, real laughter, happy
          tears, and heartfelt moments to unfold effortlessly.
        </p>
        <p>
          For us, every wedding is personal. Every couple becomes part of our
          journey, and every family leaves us with memories that go far
          beyond photographs. Our team works with one purpose: to make you
          feel relaxed, supported, and genuinely cared for from the very
          first conversation to the final delivery of your memories.
        </p>
        <p>
          Because when there's a real connection behind the camera, every
          photograph tells an honest story. At Wedding by Dimple, we don't
          just build beautiful albums — we build relationships that last long
          after the wedding day is over.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="py-4"><Flourish /></div>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 px-6 pb-24 md:grid-cols-4 md:px-10 overflow-hidden">
    {
      ["about-1", "about-2", "about-3", "about-4"].map((seed, index) => (
        <img
          src={`https://picsum.photos/seed/${seed}/500/650`}
          alt="Wedding by Dimple team moments"
          class={`aspect-[5/6] w-full rounded-sm object-cover reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-${(index % 4) * 150 + 100}`}
          loading="lazy"
          width="500"
          height="650"
        />
      ))
    }
  </section>
</Layout>
